window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Karl Kingsley never wanted to be a tower wizard, but fate doesn't ask for volunteers.</b></p> <p>When a mysterious plague begins wiping out entire towns, Karl uncovers a terrifying truth: a rival wizard is orchestrating the chaos from the shadows of the Obsidian Tower. As the death toll rises and the enemy's power grows, Karl must rally his allies, outmaneuver an army of undead, and face a wizard who has mastered the art of death itself.</p> <p>The clock is ticking, and the cost of failure is everything—his people, his realm, and his own life.</p> <p><i>In this electrifying second installment of the Master of the Towers series, Karl must prove that even an unwilling hero can become unstoppable when the stakes are life and death. </i>Tower of the Undying Mage <i>is a LitRPG/Gamelit progression fantasy adventure featuring stats, abilities, leveling, dungeon delves, magic items, town conquest, MythCraft rules, and so much more!</i></p>"; 
